@startuml
hide footbox
participant "X11 app" as App
participant AutoKey
participant "Bash picker" as Picker
participant rofi

App -> AutoKey: Type ;;dot + Space
AutoKey -> Picker: Run with dot, erase
Picker -> rofi: Display labels from dot list
rofi --> Picker: Return selected row
Picker --> App: Replace ;;dot via Shift+Insert
@enduml
